An unclosed '(' in a call on the last line: the statement never ends.
The validator reports the imbalance; the formatter must not invent a
closing token or reflow following text into the call.
-- input.ssl --
:DECLARE sOut;
sOut := Upper(AllTrim("abc");
:RETURN Left(sOut, 2
-- format --
:DECLARE sOut;
sOut := Upper(AllTrim("abc");
	:RETURN Left(sOut, 2;
-- diagnostics --
2:14-2:15 error unclosed_delimiter: Unclosed '('
3:13-3:14 error unclosed_delimiter: Unclosed '('
